{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"repeating-decimal-to-fraction UI copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer","detected_language":"de","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"repeating-decimal-to-fraction.copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer","keys":["repeating-decimal-to-fraction.copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer"],"locale":"de","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"ZXQPH0000QXZ.(ZXQPH0001QXZ) bedeutet ZXQPH0002QXZ… mit der Wiederholung von ZXQPH0003QXZ, die genau ZXQPH0004QXZ/ZXQPH0005QXZ ist.","record_id":"5e6e219249244967240fedd3ad3483acc4dc4d3eed83e683382b268bae37b15d","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.8572258174999945,"source":"0.(3) means 0.333… with 3 repeating, which is exactly 1/3.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"cc6c10053b659b34ec03bd4716f69bc92620a09c1eb92a1df27f49fd0f15942f","status":"machine-draft","translation":"0.(3) bedeutet 0.333… mit der Wiederholung von 3, die genau 1/3 ist.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"rlc-circuit-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"de","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"de","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Für das Serienmodell ist Q = ω₀L/R und die Bandbreite ist R/(ZXQPH0000QXZπL). Für das Parallelmodell ist Q = R/(ω₀L) und die Bandbreite ist ZXQPH0001QXZ/(ZXQPH0002QXZπRC).","record_id":"5ef6cf9f70fc09cb0ad08d96e90cb3b67cec22ea21fb226e4de87a74fd856d08","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.940185866749971,"source":"For the series model, Q = ω₀L/R and bandwidth is R/(2πL). For the parallel model, Q = R/(ω₀L) and bandwidth is 1/(2πRC). These are ideal single-resonance relationships.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"d929113d31b49cd67fa0b70f4d3ec5403c3e4e89c98b4fcab359fb6074436c8a","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Für das Serienmodell ist Q = ω₀L/R und die Bandbreite ist R/(2πL). Für das Parallelmodell ist Q = R/(ω₀L) und die Bandbreite ist 1/(2πRC).","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
